ow wanted Polly to get rid of the  babies but he still wouldn't tell her  the truth eventually though he had to  come clean it's been a hundred years  since the blossom family split we just  don't understand why it stayed a secret  for so long it makes no sense the gang  is the law a lot of the plot holes in  Riverdale involve the serpents this is  the gang that controls a lot of the  crime in town it's the gang that Jughead  was pressured to join by his father but  then things get really messed up FP  apparently turns his life around well  sort of but he does become the sheriff  of Riverdale sheriff Jones now boy  Riverdale has had some seriously  terrible sheriff's we'll talk more about  that later but Hermione Lodge appointed  him even though FP was a criminal he did  go to jail for murder after all but he  committed a lot more crimes than he was  convicted of sure the mayor was trying  to frame him but putting a criminal in  charge of law enforcement is not a good  way to do it  not to mention that Hermione's plan  totally backfired and that's what  happens when you lead a gang and then  the story gets crazier sheriff's can  deputize people to help them enforce the  law FP deputizes the serpent's he uses  them to help with the drug problem yes  that's right a gang that used to sell  illegal substances now has the power to  enforce the law they can even arrest  people this is more than corrupt it just  makes no sense at all what's even  crazier is that FB is probably the best  sheriff they've had how scary is that  teen leader okay we love Jacob Jones we  really do but we don't think it makes  any sense that he is the leader of the  serpents just hear us out  first of all Jughead really didn't want  to join the serpents for a long time but  once FP was put in jail Jack had decided  it was time the serpents could give him  protection so he underwent the  initiation process but he rose in the  ranks really quickly sure he is F piece  kid that made him kind of like 